The [[Shiny Shell]] is an item available in the shop for all characters, at common rarity. Its only effect is that it heals a small amount once after 5 seconds, defaulting at 5 health, but reaching up to 11 health if it's between two [[Holy]] items. This isn't a particularly efficient item, but its crafts, [[Shell Totem]] and [[Shelly]], are significantly more usable and build-defining. Holy items aren't particularly common, so the [[Shiny Shell]] is one of the best options if all the player cares about is having [[Holy]] items for other items' adjacencies, such as with [[Double Rainbow]] or [[Holy Armor]], especially since it's only one tile.
